{"speciesId":646,"names":{"fr":"Kyurem","es":"Kyurem","en":"Kyurem","ja":"キュレム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps produit une énergie à très basse température, mais le souffle glacé qu’il exhale l’a gelé lui-même."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il a le pouvoir de générer un souffle d’un froid inimaginable, mais a fini par se geler lui-même."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can produce ultracold air. Its body is frozen."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il attend le héros qui saura réanimer son corps de glace incomplet en partageant avec lui son Idéal et sa Réalité."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon legendario que aguarda al héroe que compense el vacío de su cuerpo de hielo con verdad e ideales."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"失った 体を 真実と 理想で 埋めてくれる 英雄を 待つ 氷の 伝説ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps produit une énergie à très basse température, mais le souffle glacé qu’il exhale l’a gelé lui-même."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Produce en su interior una intensa energía gélida, y cualquier fuga hace que su cuerpo se congele."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"強力な 冷凍エネルギーを 体内で 作り出すが 漏れ出した 冷気で